  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Give Hope to Kisumu&apos;s Underprivileged Children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The COVID-19 pandemic completely derailed the education journey for the poorest and most vulnerable children. RKF&apos;s main aim is to ensure school children in Kisumu always have access to quality education. We do this by ensuring students have access to two hot meals while at school, educational supplies like books and stationery and sanitary pads for girls. We also support the families of students with food rations</narrative>
  </description>
